Today is Friday.
Now the time is ten o'clock at night.
Sometimes I call my family on Friday night.
I make a video call to Mexico.
My younger sister Sofía answers the call.
She looks at my hair.
She says happily, "Maya, the new haircut is very beautiful!"
I say, "Yes, I cut my hair at seven o'clock this evening."
I see our dog on the screen.
Her name is Lola.
Lola is playing happily there.
She always plays like this.
Now the time in Mexico is morning.
After that, I talk to my father and mother.
We talk for one hour.
I hang up the call at eleven o'clock at night.
I am very happy.
I like to see them every day.
